  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The disabled car-parking spaces hereby approved shall be marked for use by disabled badge holders only, and vehicles not displaying a disabled badge shall be prevented from parking in these spaces. \r\n\r\nReason: To ensure disabled parking provision in accordance with policy TR17 (parking standards) of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development plan adopted 2000.  ",
    "Condition : 2 - The cycle storage area hereby approved shall be enclosed with a roof utilising a material matching that used within the proposed adjoining office building. \r\n\r\nReason: To ensure that the proposed cycle storage facilities are suitably weatherproof, in accordance with policy TR22 (Cycling) of the London Borough of Camden Unitary Development Plan, adopted 2000.  "
